-- Quest-relevant creature spawns at a wrong height on the CoA (WB1) terrain.
-- Found by probing all 5007 quest-relevant CoA spawns on maps 0/1 with a static height probe (the core's own
-- Map::GetHeight + vmaps on maps/vmaps extracted from the current client incl. patch-WB1). Every new value was probed
-- again: on a reachable floor (36364 deliberately on the water surface).
-- Nivelarn inn (Pale Reach): rev_20261017_76 (#8051) put innkeeper Dalignir and Gorlin at z 540.66, which is the
-- terrain height over the inn: they stand in the closed roof space 22 yd above the taproom, so "An Encrypted Message"
-- (175132) and Gorlin's quests cannot be done. Back to their rev_20261009_62 (#7047) spots (bar / cellar room).
-- Everything else: z only, guarded on guid + id + the old z (+-0.01), so a row moved in the meantime stays as it is.
